  <section class="section section--cream">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section__head reveal"><p class="eyebrow">Day by day</p><h2 class="section__title">Your 6-day journey</h2></div>
      <div class="days">
        <div class="day reveal"><div class="day__num">Day 1</div><div class="day__body"><h3>Arrive in Kigali</h3><p>Met at the airport and taken to a welcoming hotel with gardens and a pool. An easy afternoon to settle in after the flight.</p><p class="day__stay"><b>Stay:</b> Kigali hotel · <b>Meals:</b> Dinner</p></div></div>
        <div class="day reveal"><div class="day__num">Day 2</div><div class="day__body"><h3>Creative Kigali</h3><p>A hands-on day in the capital — the colourful Inema arts centre, a visit to the women-led Nyamirambo neighbourhood for cooking and crafts, and the lively Kimironko market.</p><p class="day__stay"><b>Stay:</b> Kigali hotel · <b>Meals:</b> Breakfast, lunch</p></div></div>
        <div class="day reveal"><div class="day__num">Day 3</div><div class="day__body"><h3>North to the Virunga foothills</h3><p>Drive through terraced hills to the foot of the volcanoes, with a stop at the equator and a community cultural village where children can drum, dance and learn.</p><p class="day__stay"><b>Stay:</b> Volcanoes-area lodge · <b>Meals:</b> All</p></div></div>
        <div class="day reveal"><div class="day__num">Day 4</div><div class="day__body"><h3>Golden monkeys &amp; caves</h3><p>Track the playful golden monkeys through the bamboo — a gentler, family-friendly forest walk — then explore the lava-tube Musanze caves.</p><p class="day__stay"><b>Stay:</b> Volcanoes-area lodge · <b>Meals:</b> All</p></div></div>
        <div class="day reveal"><div class="day__num">Day 5</div><div class="day__body"><h3>To Lake Kivu</h3><p>A short, scenic drive to the lake for swimming, kayaking and a boat to the islands, with sundowners over the water.</p><p class="day__stay"><b>Stay:</b> Lake Kivu lodge · <b>Meals:</b> All</p></div></div>
        <div class="day reveal"><div class="day__num">Day 6</div><div class="day__body"><h3>Return &amp; farewell</h3><p>A relaxed morning by the lake, then back to Kigali for your onward flight — full hearts and full memory cards.</p><p class="day__stay"><b>Meals:</b> Breakfast</p></div></div>
      </div>
